# Design System

## Colors (use Tailwind tokens from `globals.css` only — no arbitrary hex in TSX)
| Token | Utility |
|-------|---------|
| Primary burgundy | `bg-primary`, `text-primary`, `border-primary` |
| Hover | `bg-primary-hover`, `hover:bg-primary-hover` |
| Light tint | `bg-primary-light`, `text-primary-light` |
| Background | `bg-background` |
| Foreground | `text-foreground` |

## Typography
- **Raleway** → headings (`font-heading`, `h1–h6`)
- **Poppins** → body/UI (`font-sans`, default 15px, `leading-relaxed`)
- Hero scale: `text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold leading-[1.18] tracking-tight`

## Layout
- Max width: `max-w-[1140px] mx-auto w-full` — no outer padding unless specified
- Section vertical spacing: `py-12 lg:py-16` inside the container
- Sticky header: white glass card `bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl`
- CTAs: pill buttons `rounded-full`, primary burgundy + hover lift

## Patterns
- Icons: `react-icons/fa6` (not lucide)
- Images: placeholder from `/public`; user swaps assets themselves
- Animations: `animate-blob-liquid` for hero blobs; subtle hover transitions on nav/buttons
